<</Title(Before I finalized my application documents, I made sure the source was credible and current by doing basic checks for credibility, accuracy, bias, and currency. DXC is a well-established global IT company, and the job description matched across the platforms I checked. The posting also looked clear and straightforward, and the role description still felt aligned with what entry-level IT graduates typically start with.)/Dest[ 13 0 R /Fit]/Parent 764 0 R /Prev 773 0 R /Next 796 0 R >>
endobj
