<</Title(This Period 2 Checkpoint is an individual submission. You will create a professional application portfolio for a real or realistic job, internship, part-time position, or entry-level opportunity. The purpose is to apply information literacy, responsible AI use, professional digital communication, and word-processing skills in one practical output. Your work should look like something you would be willing to send to an actual employer. No oral presentation is required; the portfolio will be evaluated as submitted work.)/Dest[ 15 0 R /Fit]/Parent 800 0 R >>
