<</Title(Resume-Createyourownone-pageresume.Youdecidethelayout,organization,visualstyle,and section order. Include only truthful information that supports your target position. CoverLetter-Createyourownone-pagecoverletterforthesameposition.Itmustbetailoredtothe role or organization rather than copied from a generic internet template. Job/EmployerReference-Includeevidenceoftheopportunityusedasyourbasis.Thismaybea screenshot of a job post, a company careers page, a reputable job platform listing, or another clearly identified professional source. Process&IntegrityNote-Writea150-250wordreflectionexplaininghowyouresearchedthe opportunity, how you checked the information, and whether AI was used. Write this in your own format and voice.)/Dest[ 15 0 R /Fit]/Parent 812 0 R >>
endobj
